{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And it shall be, I will answer</b> — like \"and silver will answer for everything\" — it means provide." "And the meaning of אענה — sometimes [it has the sense of] always, in the manner of נשאו נהרות יהוה, as I explained." "<b>I will answer the heavens</b> — the opposite of \"and I will make your skies like iron.\"" "<b>And they will answer the earth</b> — that they will give their dew and their rains in their time."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:12.312122874Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}